# Pinglet Environment Variables

# Slack user token (xoxp-...) for sending notifications to your DM
# Get this from: https://api.slack.com/apps → Your App → OAuth & Permissions
SLACK_USER_TOKEN=xoxp-your-token-here

# Default Slack channel for notifications (your DM channel ID)
# Find this in Slack: right-click channel → View channel details → scroll to bottom
SLACK_DEFAULT_CHANNEL=DXXXXXXXXXX
